{"content":"{\n  \"chapter_contract_id\": \"contract:v2-n-9-1:v2\",\n  \"node_id\": \"v2_n_9_1\",\n  \"schema_version\": \"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\n  \"known_evidence_ids\": [],\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"block:v2-n-9-1:framework\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"本节疗效评估应覆盖已确认的研究目的、疗效终点、测量口径、评估者角色与评估时点，并与已接受的研究流程表（SOA）保持一致。疗效评估框架范围【待补充：疗效评估框架范围：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"block:v2-n-9-1:primary-trace\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"主要终点应回链至已确认的主要目的：在既往至少接受过一线系统治疗且对来那度胺敏感的多发性骨髓瘤试验参与者中，评价合成药K单药（5 mg/kg IV Q4W；IV=静脉注射，Q4W=每4周一次）相较于来那度胺联合地塞米松（Rd）双模拟对照（来那度胺25 mg D1-21 + 地塞米松40 mg D1、8、15、22）在总缓解率（ORR）方面的优效性。主要终点应定义为ORR，按国际骨髓瘤工作组（IMWG）疗效评价标准定义。主要终点测量方法、派生规则与缺失数据处理【待补充：主要终点测量方法、派生规则与缺失数据处理：该项待研究团队确认后补充】；主要终点向主要估计目标的回链【待补充：主要估计目标（目标人群、变量、伴发事件处理策略和群体汇总）：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"block:v2-n-9-1:endpoint-map\",\n      \"kind\": \"table\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"table\": {\n        \"table_id\": \"table:v2-n-9-1:endpoint-map\",\n        \"block_id\": \"block:v2-n-9-1:endpoint-map\",\n        \"schema_version\": \"structured_table_v1\",\n        \"domain\": \"objectives_endpoints\",\n        \"role\": \"body_content\",\n        \"header_row_count\": 1,\n        \"title\": \"疗效终点与目的、估计目标映射表\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          {\n            \"column_id\": \"efficacy:col:objective\",\n            \"label\": \"研究目的\",\n            \"order\": 0,\n            \"semantic_role\": \"objective\",\n            \"style_role\": \"header\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"column_id\": \"efficacy:col:endpoint\",\n            \"label\": \"疗效终点\",\n            \"order\": 1,\n            \"semantic_role\": \"endpoint\",\n            \"style_role\": \"header\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"column_id\": \"efficacy:col:estimand\",\n            \"label\": \"估计目标\",\n            \"order\": 2,\n            \"semantic_role\": \"estimand\",\n            \"style_role\": \"header\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"row_id\": \"efficacy:row:primary\",\n            \"order\": 0,\n            \"style_role\": \"body\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"\",\n            \"cells\": [\n              {\n                \"cell_id\": \"efficacy:cell:objective\",\n                \"row_id\": \"efficacy:row:primary\",\n                \"column_id\": \"efficacy:col:objective\",\n                \"text\": \"在既往至少接受过一线系统治疗且对来那度胺敏感的多发性骨髓瘤试验参与者中，评价合成药K单药（5 mg/kg IV Q4W）相较于来那度胺联合地塞米松（Rd）双模拟对照（来那度胺25 mg D1-21 + 地塞米松40 mg D1、8、15、22）在总缓解率（ORR）方面的优效性。\",\n                \"style_role\": \"body\",\n                \"source_locator\": \"\",\n                \"provenance_lineage\": [],\n                \"note_refs\": []\n              },\n              {\n                \"cell_id\": \"efficacy:cell:endpoint\",\n                \"row_id\": \"efficacy:row:primary\",\n                \"column_id\": \"efficacy:col:endpoint\",\n                \"text\": \"总缓解率（ORR），按国际骨髓瘤工作组（IMWG）疗效评价标准定义；比较合成药K单药与Rd对照的ORR以检验优效性。\",\n                \"style_role\": \"body\",\n                \"source_locator\": \"\",\n                \"provenance_lineage\": [],\n                \"note_refs\": []\n              },\n              {\n                \"cell_id\": \"efficacy:cell:estimand\",\n                \"row_id\": \"efficacy:row:primary\",\n                \"column_id\": \"efficacy:col:estimand\",\n                \"text\": \"【待补充：主要估计目标（目标人群、变量、伴发事件处理策略和群体汇总）：该项待研究团队确认后补充】\",\n                \"style_role\": \"body\",\n                \"source_locator\": \"\",\n                \"provenance_lineage\": [],\n                \"note_refs\": []\n              }\n            ]\n          },\n          {\n            \"row_id\": \"efficacy:row:pfs\",\n            \"order\": 1,\n            \"style_role\": \"body\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"\",\n            \"cells\": [\n              {\n                \"cell_id\": \"efficacy:cell:pfs:objective\",\n                \"row_id\": \"efficacy:row:pfs\",\n                \"column_id\": \"efficacy:col:objective\",\n                \"text\": \"【待补充：无进展生存期对应的关键次要目的：该项待研究团队确认后补充】\",\n                \"style_role\": \"body\",\n                \"source_locator\": \"\",\n                \"provenance_lineage\": [],\n                \"note_refs\": []\n              },\n              {\n                \"cell_id\": \"efficacy:cell:pfs:endpoint\",\n                \"row_id\": \"efficacy:row:pfs\",\n                \"column_id\": \"efficacy:col:endpoint\",\n                \"text\": \"无进展生存期（PFS），按IMWG标准评估，从随机化至首次记录疾病进展（PD）或任何原因死亡（以先发生者为准）。\",\n                \"style_role\": \"body\",\n                \"source_locator\": \"\",\n                \"provenance_lineage\": [],\n                \"note_refs\": []\n              },\n              {\n                \"cell_id\": \"efficacy:cell:pfs:estimand\",\n                \"row_id\": \"efficacy:row:pfs\",\n                \"column_id\": \"efficacy:col:estimand\",\n                \"text\": \"【待补充：无进展生存期的估计目标：该项待研究团队确认后补充】\",\n                \"style_role\": \"body\",\n                \"source_locator\": \"\",\n                \"provenance_lineage\": [],\n                \"note_refs\": []\n              }\n            ]\n          },\n          {\n            \"row_id\": \"efficacy:row:os\",\n            \"order\": 2,\n            \"style_role\": \"body\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"\",\n            \"cells\": [\n              {\n                \"cell_id\": \"efficacy:cell:os:objective\",\n                \"row_id\": \"efficacy:row:os\",\n                \"column_id\": \"efficacy:col:objective\",\n                \"text\": \"【待补充：总生存期对应的关键次要目的：该项待研究团队确认后补充】\",\n                \"style_role\": \"body\",\n                \"source_locator\": \"\",\n                \"provenance_lineage\": [],\n                \"note_refs\": []\n              },\n              {\n                \"cell_id\": \"efficacy:cell:os:endpoint\",\n                \"row_id\": \"efficacy:row:os\",\n                \"column_id\": \"efficacy:col:endpoint\",\n                \"text\": \"总生存期（OS），从随机化至任何原因死亡。\",\n                \"style_role\": \"body\",\n                \"source_locator\": \"\",\n                \"provenance_lineage\": [],\n                \"note_refs\": []\n              },\n              {\n                \"cell_id\": \"efficacy:cell:os:estimand\",\n                \"row_id\": \"efficacy:row:os\",\n                \"column_id\": \"efficacy:col:estimand\",\n                \"text\": \"【待补充：总生存期的估计目标：该项待研究团队确认后补充】\",\n                \"style_role\": \"body\",\n                \"source_locator\": \"\",\n                \"provenance_lineage\": [],\n                \"note_refs\": []\n              }\n            ]\n          },\n          {\n            \"row_id\": \"efficacy:row:dor\",\n            \"order\": 3,\n            \"style_role\": \"body\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"\",\n            \"cells\": [\n              {\n                \"cell_id\": \"efficacy:cell:dor:objective\",\n                \"row_id\": \"efficacy:row:dor\",\n                \"column_id\": \"efficacy:col:objective\",\n                \"text\": \"【待补充：缓解持续时间对应的关键次要目的：该项待研究团队确认后补充】\",\n                \"style_role\": \"body\",\n                \"source_locator\": \"\",\n                \"provenance_lineage\": [],\n                \"note_refs\": []\n              },\n              {\n                \"cell_id\": \"efficacy:cell:dor:endpoint\",\n                \"row_id\": \"efficacy:row:dor\",\n                \"column_id\": \"efficacy:col:endpoint\",\n                \"text\": \"缓解持续时间（DOR），从首次达到≥部分缓解（PR）至首次记录PD或死亡（以先发生者为准），仅针对确认缓解者。\",\n                \"style_role\": \"body\",\n                \"source_locator\": \"\",\n                \"provenance_lineage\": [],\n                \"note_refs\": []\n              },\n              {\n                \"cell_id\": \"efficacy:cell:dor:estimand\",\n                \"row_id\": \"efficacy:row:dor\",\n                \"column_id\": \"efficacy:col:estimand\",\n                \"text\": \"【待补充：缓解持续时间的估计目标：该项待研究团队确认后补充】\",\n                \"style_role\": \"body\",\n                \"source_locator\": \"\",\n                \"provenance_lineage\": [],\n                \"note_refs\": []\n              }\n            ]\n          },\n          {\n            \"row_id\": \"efficacy:row:safety\",\n            \"order\": 4,\n            \"style_role\": \"body\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"\",\n            \"cells\": [\n              {\n                \"cell_id\": \"efficacy:cell:safety:objective\",\n                \"row_id\": \"efficacy:row:safety\",\n                \"column_id\": \"efficacy:col:objective\",\n                \"text\": \"【待补充：安全性终点对应的关键次要目的：该项待研究团队确认后补充】\",\n                \"style_role\": \"body\",\n                \"source_locator\": \"\",\n                \"provenance_lineage\": [],\n                \"note_refs\": []\n              },\n              {\n                \"cell_id\": \"efficacy:cell:safety:endpoint\",\n                \"row_id\": \"efficacy:row:safety\",\n                \"column_id\": \"efficacy:col:endpoint\",\n                \"text\": \"安全性终点：治疗中出现的不良事件（TEAE）、≥3级TEAE、严重不良事件（SAE）、导致剂量下调、延迟或终止的事件发生率。\",\n                \"style_role\": \"body\",\n                \"source_locator\": \"\",\n                \"provenance_lineage\": [],\n                \"note_refs\": []\n              },\n              {\n                \"cell_id\": \"efficacy:cell:safety:estimand\",\n                \"row_id\": \"efficacy:row:safety\",\n                \"column_id\": \"efficacy:col:estimand\",\n                \"text\": \"【待补充：安全性终点的估计目标：该项待研究团队确认后补充】\",\n                \"style_role\": \"body\",\n                \"source_locator\": \"\",\n                \"provenance_lineage\": [],\n                \"note_refs\": []\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        ],\n        \"notes\": [],\n        \"review_state\": \"ai_draft\",\n        \"source_locator\": \"\",\n        \"version\": 0,\n        \"word_layout\": {}\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"block:v2-n-9-1:measurement\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"终点测量口径应项目化书写。主要终点及需按国际骨髓瘤工作组（IMWG）标准评估的次要终点所采用的标准及其版本【待补充：国际骨髓瘤工作组疗效评价标准及其版本：该项待研究团队确认后补充】；所有疗效终点的评估者角色与培训要求【待补充：评估者角色与培训要求：该项待研究团队确认后补充】；评估时点与窗口应与已接受的研究流程表（SOA）一致，具体评估时点与窗口【待补充：评估时点与窗口：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"block:v2-n-9-1:secondary\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"关键次要终点的测量方法应项目化书写。无进展生存期（PFS）应按IMWG标准评估，从随机化至首次记录疾病进展（PD）或任何原因死亡（以先发生者为准）；总生存期（OS）应从随机化至任何原因死亡；缓解持续时间（DOR）应从首次达到≥部分缓解（PR）至首次记录PD或死亡（以先发生者为准），且仅针对确认缓解者；安全性终点应包括治疗中出现的不良事件（TEAE）、≥3级TEAE、严重不良事件（SAE）、导致剂量下调、延迟或终止的事件发生率。上述关键次要终点的目的与估计目标【待补充：关键次要终点的目的与估计目标：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"c1697b8156f61d70195ddfebc85029f8470b990d53406b95c4ffd38c570056fc"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:afbd21a45600b1c4fe2e540b431b06ad6c0cdf8cd986319a1207d57b25979100:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:afbd21a45600b1c4fe2e540b431b06ad6c0cdf8cd986319a1207d57b25979100:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-flash","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-candidate.v1.json","output_sha256":"4280e8a1e7c4ce878e21e3c34ed01d2b6199323903d495d45452688991dbdebe","prompt_sha256":"5322c0235bbedc2213b004747cbd757992154e907fd360b9bf